  "description": "A powerful framework that allows creating user-defined functions for Mathcad 15 and Mathcad Prime using any .NET language (C#, VB.NET, F#, C++/CLI).\nThis package provides a simple, attribute-based API that hides the complexity of the underlying C++/CLI host. Developers can write clean, strongly-typed functions by inheriting from a generic base class, focusing purely on their logic without boilerplate code.",
  "id": "NetEFI.Framework",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2025-08-31T20:15:22.587Z",
  "licenseExpression": "MIT",
  "licenseUrl": "https://licenses.nuget.org/MIT",
  "listed": true,
  "packageHash": "D1VHnf0OixuyOBZ/ZldWGxXgo7dtXFZFv1wEf2DcJSfKy4M7tbTUxScJng8TnIvNr4byeRNBi3eb0lS7N3et5w==",
